{
  "ko_slug": "퍼미션-마케팅-어떻게-해야-제대로-할-수-있을까",
  "source_hash": "ebfb0640418a00b4b3710ef78d9b12395fe756aceb37d5f80f8f19d830f275f5",
  "en": {
    "slug": "how-to-run-permission-marketing-properly",
    "title": "How to run permission marketing properly",
    "excerpt": "Check consent, lead reuse and lead quality when choosing a permission-marketing provider.",
    "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\">﻿</span><span style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"></span></p><div class=\"se-component se-quotation se-l-quotation_postit\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"__se-toolbar-slot\"><div></div></div><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-quotation se-l-quotation_postit se-section-align-left __se-unit se-is-selected se-is-block-selected\"><div class=\"se-quotation-container\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-quote\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs19 __se-node\"><b>How to run permission marketing properly</b></span></p></div><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-is-empty se-cite\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height:1.5;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs13 __se-node\"></span> </p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> Interest in permission marketing has recently grown in the CPA industry.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> Permission means authorization or consent. This approach targets people who have already agreed to receive product information. It costs more than ordinary CPA but offers greater reliability.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> We receive many inquiries from stock-market marketers, lottery businesses acquiring leads through CPA, and advertisers seeking people interested in insurance or loan consultations. At J-Curve Interactive, we provide leads with advance consent to promotional notifications and third-party sharing, resulting in a high advertising-contract renewal rate.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> However, careless permission marketing can cause problems. Let's examine them.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-fit\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-left se-is-selected se-is-block-selected\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-image __se-unit se-is-selected\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><img src=\"https://blogfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyMDExMTFfMTM5/MDAxNjA1MDgwMzU3ODk2.sqYM3koA-qmgb75SCYE8ol1CIioEVqZgHomPq3HTADEg.J_DKfXV62D2og3USXknbRTquGRvxo6IERAMGhtPSeaYg.PNG.j-curve/CPA_%EA%B4%91%EA%B3%A0%EB%A7%88%EC%BC%80%ED%8C%85_(7).png?type=w1\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" width=\"886\"></div> </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-is-empty\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-quotation se-l-quotation_line\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-quotation se-l-quotation_line se-section-align-left __se-unit se-is-selected se-is-block-selected\"><div class=\"se-quotation-container\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-quote\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs19 __se-node\"><b> 1. Potential violations of personal-information protection law</b></span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs19 __se-node\"><b></b></span></p></div><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-is-empty se-cite\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.5;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs13 __se-node\"></span> </p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> This is probably the main issue. As demand grows, many agencies enter permission marketing. Yet not all obtain the necessary consent for third-party sharing, marketing use and event notifications when collecting leads.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> Using leads without that basic consent, believing them to be permission-based, can cause serious problems.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-quotation se-l-quotation_line\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-quotation se-l-quotation_line se-section-align-left __se-unit se-is-selected se-is-block-selected\"><div class=\"se-quotation-container\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-quote\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs19 __se-node\"><b> 2. Recycled leads</b></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs19 __se-node\"><b> </b></span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> Agencies run ads, collect initial consent, call each prospect and obtain permission before delivering the lead. Advertising, calls and related resources make costs higher than expected. Some unscrupulous agencies supply the same leads to several advertisers to avoid these costs and offer lower prices. Advertisers may appear to benefit from cheap leads, but effectiveness falls because others receive them too.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-fit\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-left se-is-selected se-is-block-selected\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-image __se-unit se-is-selected\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><img src=\"https://blogfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyMDExMTFfMTcy/MDAxNjA1MDgwMzY0NzQ2.s8c2t8LPT8b_64EmYx-VnulpCCz9JBAH4O1IGmrkAzMg.oLRrKyW_Oimmcf_9n5rXwQ6AJSoooA35hP50t-RHBUUg.PNG.j-curve/CPA_%EA%B4%91%EA%B3%A0%EB%A7%88%EC%BC%80%ED%8C%85_(8).png?type=w1\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" width=\"886\"></div> </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-is-empty\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-quotation se-l-quotation_line\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-quotation se-l-quotation_line se-section-align-left __se-unit se-is-selected se-is-block-selected\"><div class=\"se-quotation-container\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-quote\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs19 __se-node\"><b> 3. Low-quality consented leads</b></span></p></div><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-is-empty se-cite\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.5;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs13 __se-node\"></span> </p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> Even with initial approval, exaggerated benefits or false claims used to attract prospects sharply reduce quality, though they make leads cheaper. Simply announcing “We will call you later” without actual approval produces especially poor leads and weak marketing results.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-fit\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-left se-is-selected se-is-block-selected\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-image __se-unit se-is-selected\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><img src=\"https://blogfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyMDExMTFfODgg/MDAxNjA1MDgwMzcyMzI1.ogNTHkX8aq7kbrx9wMnorDFT0oVzO3p_W64C4FhQ_-wg.NPxMIYef9OIaCwx4CmAzRY5WXXpgcXcy26ganb612yAg.PNG.j-curve/%ED%8D%BC%EB%AF%B8%EC%85%98_%EB%A7%88%EC%BC%80%ED%8C%85_%EC%83%81%EB%8B%B4%EB%AC%B8%EC%9D%98_(1).png?type=w1\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" width=\"886\"></div> </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-quotation se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-quotation se-l-default se-section-align-left __se-unit se-is-selected se-is-block-selected\"><div class=\"se-quotation-container\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-quote\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanummyeongjo se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color:rgb(119,119,119);\"><b><i> Pay a fair price to a trusted provider</i></b></span></p></div><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-is-empty se-cite\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height:1.5;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs13 __se-node\"></span> </p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> How can you avoid these problems? We recommend paying a fair price to a trusted provider. Besides J-Curve Interactive, several agencies handle permission marketing well. Choose one of them.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> What should you look for? First, an ability to generate leads. Second, an in-house consultation center. Third, a long operating history. Fourth, pricing consistent with the market.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> Be wary of providers who sell only on price or promise to be cheap or match any price. This helps you use marketing funds properly.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"><br></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> Are you considering permission marketing?</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> Contact J-Curve Interactive.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"> Whether or not you proceed, we will discuss your needs carefully.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><p><span style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\">﻿</span> </p>",
    "meta_title": "How to run permission marketing properly",
    "meta_description": "Check consent, lead reuse and lead quality when choosing a permission-marketing provider."
  },
  "ja": {
    "slug": "how-to-run-permission-marketing-properly",
    "title": "パーミッションマーケティングの進め方",
    "excerpt": "パーミッションマーケティングの委託先を選ぶ際に、同意、リードの使い回し、品質を確認します。",
    "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\">﻿</span><span style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"></span></p><div class=\"se-component se-quotation se-l-quotation_postit\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"__se-toolbar-slot\"><div></div></div><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-quotation se-l-quotation_postit se-section-align-left __se-unit se-is-selected se-is-block-selected\"><div class=\"se-quotation-container\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-quote\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs19 __se-node\"><b>パーミッションマーケティングを適切に進めるにはどうすればよいでしょうか。</b></span></p></div><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-is-empty se-cite\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height:1.5;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs13 __se-node\"></span> </p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\">最近、CPA業界で関心が高まっています。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\">パーミッションとは許可や同意です。商品案内に既に同意した見込み客が対象なので、通常のCPAより単価は高いものの、信頼性が高い方法です。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\">株式や宝くじのCPAでリードを得る担当者、保険・融資の相談希望者を求める広告主から、多くの相談があります。J-Curve Interactiveは販促通知と第三者提供への事前同意を得たリードを渡しており、契約更新率も高くなっています。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\">ただし、無造作に進めると問題が起こります。具体例を見ましょう。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-fit\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-left se-is-selected se-is-block-selected\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-image __se-unit se-is-selected\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><img src=\"https://blogfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyMDExMTFfMTM5/MDAxNjA1MDgwMzU3ODk2.sqYM3koA-qmgb75SCYE8ol1CIioEVqZgHomPq3HTADEg.J_DKfXV62D2og3USXknbRTquGRvxo6IERAMGhtPSeaYg.PNG.j-curve/CPA_%EA%B4%91%EA%B3%A0%EB%A7%88%EC%BC%80%ED%8C%85_(7).png?type=w1\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" width=\"886\"></div> </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-is-empty\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-quotation se-l-quotation_line\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-quotation se-l-quotation_line se-section-align-left __se-unit se-is-selected se-is-block-selected\"><div class=\"se-quotation-container\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-quote\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs19 __se-node\"><b>1. 個人情報保護法に抵触する可能性</b></span><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs19 __se-node\"><b></b></span></p></div><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-is-empty se-cite\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.5;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs13 __se-node\"></span> </p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\">代表的な問題です。需要増に伴い多くの代理店が参入していますが、収集時に第三者提供、販促利用、イベント案内などの同意をすべて取得する例は多くありません。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\">基本同意のない情報を、同意取得済みだと思って使うと大きな問題になります。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-quotation se-l-quotation_line\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-quotation se-l-quotation_line se-section-align-left __se-unit se-is-selected se-is-block-selected\"><div class=\"se-quotation-container\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-quote\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs19 __se-node\"><b>2. リードの使い回し</b></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs19 __se-node\"><b> </b></span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\">代理店は広告で一次同意を得て、一人ずつ電話し、許可を得てから渡します。広告や電話相談などの資源で原価は高くなります。一部の不適切な代理店は同じ情報を複数社に渡し、安く提供します。広告主は得したように見えても、競合にも届くため効果は下がります。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-fit\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-left se-is-selected se-is-block-selected\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-image __se-unit se-is-selected\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><img src=\"https://blogfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyMDExMTFfMTcy/MDAxNjA1MDgwMzY0NzQ2.s8c2t8LPT8b_64EmYx-VnulpCCz9JBAH4O1IGmrkAzMg.oLRrKyW_Oimmcf_9n5rXwQ6AJSoooA35hP50t-RHBUUg.PNG.j-curve/CPA_%EA%B4%91%EA%B3%A0%EB%A7%88%EC%BC%80%ED%8C%85_(8).png?type=w1\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" width=\"886\"></div> </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-is-empty\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-quotation se-l-quotation_line\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-quotation se-l-quotation_line se-section-align-left __se-unit se-is-selected se-is-block-selected\"><div class=\"se-quotation-container\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-quote\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs19 __se-node\"><b>3. 質の低い同意取得済みリード</b></span></p></div><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-is-empty se-cite\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.5;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs13 __se-node\"></span> </p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\">一次同意があっても、誇大な特典や虚偽で誘うと質は大きく下がり、単価も安くなります。実際の承認なしに「後ほど電話します」と通知しただけの情報は特に質が低く、効果を得にくくなります。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-fit\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-left se-is-selected se-is-block-selected\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-image __se-unit se-is-selected\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><img src=\"https://blogfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyMDExMTFfODgg/MDAxNjA1MDgwMzcyMzI1.ogNTHkX8aq7kbrx9wMnorDFT0oVzO3p_W64C4FhQ_-wg.NPxMIYef9OIaCwx4CmAzRY5WXXpgcXcy26ganb612yAg.PNG.j-curve/%ED%8D%BC%EB%AF%B8%EC%85%98_%EB%A7%88%EC%BC%80%ED%8C%85_%EC%83%81%EB%8B%B4%EB%AC%B8%EC%9D%98_(1).png?type=w1\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" width=\"886\"></div> </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-quotation se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-quotation se-l-default se-section-align-left __se-unit se-is-selected se-is-block-selected\"><div class=\"se-quotation-container\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-quote\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanummyeongjo se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color:rgb(119,119,119);\"><b><i>適正価格で信頼できる委託先を選びます</i></b></span></p></div><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-is-empty se-cite\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height:1.5;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs13 __se-node\"></span> </p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\"><div class=\"se-component-content\"><div class=\"se-drop-indicator\"><div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\"><div class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\">問題を避けるには、適正な対価を払って信頼できる会社に頼むことを勧めます。当社以外にも得意な代理店はあります。そうした会社を選びましょう。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\">条件は、第一に自らリードを獲得できること、第二に自社相談センターがあること、第三に業歴が長いこと、第四に相場に合う価格であることです。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:1.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs15 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\">価格だけを売りにし、必ず安くする、何でも合わせると約束する会社には注意します。広告費を無駄にせず活用するためです。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"><br></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\">この施策を検討していますか。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\">J-Curve Interactiveにご相談ください。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\">実施するかどうかにかかわらず、丁寧にお話を伺います。</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-left\" style=\"line-height:2.8;\"><span class=\"se-ff-nanumbarungothic se-fs16 __se-node\"></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><p><span style=\"font-family:'Malgun Gothic';font-size:medium;\">﻿</span> </p>",
    "meta_title": "パーミッションマーケティングの進め方",
    "meta_description": "パーミッションマーケティングの委託先を選ぶ際に、同意、リードの使い回し、品質を確認します。"
  }
}
